  "body": "Part of this is tracked by #5168 where I think we have good solutions for initial about:blank. #4916 tracks this for COEP.\r\n\r\n<s>`data:` cannot work as it's not a secure context.</s>\r\n\r\n`about:blank` and `blob:` remain for popups. I think we should inherit for them as we do normally, presumably from the source <s>browsing context</s> document.\r\n\r\nWork in progress tests:\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/19947\r\n* https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/19949\r\n* https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/17730 (forbidding navigation to top-level `data:`)\r\n\r\ncc @clelland @zcorpan @jugglinmike @ParisMeuleman @mikewest @hemeryar",
